+## For agents
+
+For current stable database client spans, use span kind `CLIENT`. Identify the database product with `db.system.name`; use `db.namespace` and `db.collection.name` for the logical namespace and collection, and `db.operation.name` for the operation. Put query text in `db.query.text` only when the documented collection rules permit it; non-parameterized text should not be collected by default unless sanitization excludes sensitive data. Do not mix these fields with the historical `db.system`, `db.name`, `db.sql.table`, `db.operation`, or `db.statement` attributes, which the migration guide removes or renames.
+<!-- phase-3-for-agents:end -->
